('bcps-audit-error-guide','Nov 5: the audit is a component in each hub with a view per role, not an Audit Hub (Sean). Live: Audit team tools on the Run Audit tab (PR 252) with the still-stuck queue (9 open), rule review (0 of 36 decided) and Finalsite items (18). Assignments: audit-hub, still-stuck-queue-visibility, audit-message-wording, audit-followups-nov-3.'),
